@startuml Runtime Diagram
title Runtime Diagram - Wiki guide + kreiranje, zavrsni kviz, recenzije i resavanje slucaja + profil korisnika + korisnicka podrska + admin panel

actor "Korisnik" as User
participant "Frontend Router" as Router
participant "DesktopGate" as Gate
participant "LoginPage" as Login
participant "App Route Guard" as Guard
participant "LoggedHomePage" as LoggedHome
participant "CreateCasePage (/slucaj/novi)" as CreateCaseStart
participant "CaseWorkspacePage" as Workspace
participant "CreateCaseSidebar" as WorkspaceSidebar
participant "CaseTimelineTab" as TimelineTab
participant "CasePeopleTab" as PeopleTab
participant "CaseStatementsTab" as StatementsTab
participant "CasePoliceDocumentsTab" as DocsTab
participant "CaseInterrogationsTab" as InterrogationsTab
participant "CaseQuizTab" as QuizTab
participant "ProfilePage" as ProfilePage
participant "SupportPage" as SupportPage
participant "WikiPage (/wiki)" as WikiPage
participant "Cases API Client" as CasesClient
participant "Case Timeline API Client" as TimelineClient
participant "Case People API Client" as PeopleClient
participant "Case Documents API Client" as DocumentsClient
participant "Case Interrogations API Client" as InterrogationsClient
participant "Case Quiz API Client" as QuizClient
participant "Case Reviews API Client" as ReviewsClient
participant "Case Progress API Client" as ProgressClient
participant "Profile API Client" as ProfileClient
participant "Support API Client" as SupportClient
participant "Auth API Client" as AuthClient
participant "Express Auth API" as AuthApi
participant "Express Cases API" as CasesApi
participant "Express Profile API" as ProfileApi
participant "Express Support API" as SupportApi
participant "Express Admin API" as AdminApi
participant "Auth Guard (JWT)" as JwtGuard
participant "Admin Panel Guard (JWT scope)" as AdminGuard
participant "Cases Service" as CasesService
participant "Case Timeline Service" as TimelineService
participant "Case People Service" as PeopleService
participant "Case Documents Service" as DocumentsService
participant "Case Interrogations Service" as InterrogationsService
participant "Case Quiz Service" as QuizService
participant "Case Reviews Service" as ReviewsService
participant "Case Progress Service" as ProgressService
participant "Case Publish Service" as PublishService
participant "Profile Service" as ProfileService
participant "Support Service" as SupportService
participant "Admin Service" as AdminService
participant "Case Solve Visibility Service" as SolveVisibility
participant "Case Solve Roles Service" as SolveRoles
participant "Cases Repository" as CasesRepo
participant "Case Timeline Repository" as TimelineRepo
participant "Case Progress Repository" as ProgressRepo
participant "Case People Repository" as PeopleRepo
participant "Case Documents Repository" as DocumentsRepo
participant "Case Interrogations Repository" as InterrogationsRepo
participant "Case Quiz Repository" as QuizRepo
participant "Case Reviews Repository" as ReviewsRepo
participant "Case Publish Repository" as PublishRepo
participant "Profile Repository" as ProfileRepo
participant "Support Repository" as SupportRepo
participant "Admin Repository" as AdminRepo
actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "Admin Login View" as AdminLoginView
participant "Admin Dashboard" as AdminDashboard
participant "Admin API Client" as AdminClient
database "SQLite users" as UsersStore
database "SQLite cases/timeline/progress" as CasesStore
database "SQLite people + dossiers + role assignments" as PeopleStore
database "SQLite case_documents(metadata_json)" as DocumentsStore
database "SQLite case_interrogations + nodes" as InterrogationsStore
database "SQLite case_quiz_questions/options/results" as QuizStore
database "SQLite support_tickets" as SupportStore
database "LocalStorage (session)" as SessionStore
database "LocalStorage (admin session)" as AdminSessionStore
participant "Desktop Notice View" as Notice

User -> Router: Otvara /wiki
Router -> Gate: Provera desktop pravila

alt Desktop sirina
  Gate -> WikiPage: Render wiki stranice
  User -> WikiPage: Pregled obrasca koriscenja i ruta
  WikiPage -> Router: Navigacija na /prijava
  Router -> Gate: Provera desktop pravila
  Gate -> Login: Render prijavne forme
  User -> Login: Unos kredencijala i submit
  Login -> AuthClient: POST /api/auth/login
  AuthClient -> AuthApi: HTTP zahtev
  AuthApi --> AuthClient: JWT token + user payload
  AuthClient -> SessionStore: Upis tokena i korisnika

  Login -> Router: Navigacija na /app
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> LoggedHome: Render ulogovane pocetne

  LoggedHome -> CasesClient: GET /api/cases/home
  CasesClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> CasesService: getLoggedHomeOverview(userId)
  CasesService -> CasesRepo: getHomeOverviewRows(userId)
  CasesRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT sekcije + statistika
  CasesStore --> CasesRepo: podaci
  CasesRepo --> CasesService: agregat
  CasesService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> CasesClient: JSON uspeh
  CasesClient --> LoggedHome: Prikaz kartica slucajeva

  User -> LoggedHome: Klik "Pokreni resavanje" na javnom slucaju
  LoggedHome -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/resavanje/vremenska-linija
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Otvaranje solve moda za izabrani javni slucaj

  User -> LoggedHome: Klik "Otvori statistiku" na objavljenom kreiranom slucaju
  LoggedHome -> ReviewsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/reviews?scope=create
  ReviewsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> ReviewsService: getCaseReviews(caseId, userId, "create")
  ReviewsService -> CasesRepo: findCaseByIdForAuthor(caseId, userId)
  ReviewsService -> ReviewsRepo: getCaseReviewSummary(caseId)
  ReviewsService -> ReviewsRepo: getResolvedCaseUsersByCaseId(caseId)
  ReviewsService -> ReviewsRepo: getCaseReviewsByCaseId(caseId)
  ReviewsRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT progress/rating/komentari + korisnici
  CasesStore --> ReviewsRepo: agregat + liste
  ReviewsRepo --> ReviewsService: summary + solvedUsers + reviews
  ReviewsService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> ReviewsClient: JSON uspeh
  ReviewsClient --> LoggedHome: Otvaranje popup panela statistike slucaja

  User -> LoggedHome: Klik "Kreiraj novi slucaj"
  LoggedHome -> Router: /slucaj/novi
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> CreateCaseStart: Forma naziv + opis

  User -> CreateCaseStart: Klik "Kreiraj slucaj"
  CreateCaseStart -> CasesClient: POST /api/cases
  CasesClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> CasesService: createCase(payload, userId)
  CasesService -> CasesRepo: createCaseWithDetails(...)
  CasesRepo -> CasesStore: INSERT case + inicijalni podaci
  CasesStore --> CasesRepo: novi caseId
  CasesRepo --> CasesService: case row
  CasesService --> CasesApi: 201 response
  CasesApi --> CasesClient: id slucaja

  CreateCaseStart -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/vremenska-linija
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Ucitavanje case workspace-a
  Workspace -> CasesClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/overview?scope=create
  CasesClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> CasesService: getCaseWorkspaceOverview(caseId, userId, "create")
  CasesService -> CasesRepo: findCaseByIdForAuthor(caseId, userId)
  CasesService -> QuizRepo: getCaseQuizQuestionCount(caseId)
  CasesRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT slucaj po id + author
  QuizRepo -> QuizStore: SELECT broj kviz pitanja
  CasesStore --> CasesRepo: case row
  QuizStore --> QuizRepo: broj pitanja
  CasesRepo --> CasesService: case row
  CasesService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> CasesClient: JSON uspeh
  CasesClient --> Workspace: Osnovni podaci slucaja + kviz statistika

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik "Objavi slucaj"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> CasesClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/publish
  CasesClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> PublishService: publishCreatorCase(caseId, authorUserId)
  PublishService -> CasesRepo: findCaseByIdForAuthor(caseId, authorUserId)

  alt Slucaj je vec objavljen
    PublishService --> CasesApi: response payload (alreadyPublished=true)
    CasesApi --> CasesClient: JSON uspeh
    CasesClient --> WorkspaceSidebar: Status poruka "Slucaj je vec objavljen."
  else Slucaj jos nije objavljen
    PublishService -> PublishRepo: getCasePublishReadinessSnapshot(caseId)
    PublishRepo -> PeopleStore: SELECT osobe + timeline pokrivenost osoba
    PublishRepo -> DocumentsStore: SELECT obavezni tipovi + timeline pokrivenost dokumenata
    PublishRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT broj timeline stavki

    alt Publish uslovi nisu ispunjeni
      PublishService --> CasesApi: 400 response sa blockerima
      CasesApi --> CasesClient: JSON greska
      CasesClient --> WorkspaceSidebar: Prikaz poruke o neuslovima za objavu
    else Publish uslovi su ispunjeni
      PublishService -> PublishRepo: updateCasePublicationStatus(caseId, "published")
      PublishRepo -> CasesStore: UPDATE cases(publication_status='published')
      CasesStore --> PublishRepo: potvrda promjene statusa
      PublishService --> CasesApi: response payload (alreadyPublished=false)
      CasesApi --> CasesClient: JSON uspeh
      CasesClient --> WorkspaceSidebar: Potvrda uspesne objave
    end
  end

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik "Vrati slucaj u resavanje"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> ProgressClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/progress/reset-to-solve
  ProgressClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> ProgressService: resetCreatorCaseProgressToSolve(caseId, authorUserId)
  ProgressService -> CasesRepo: findCaseByIdForAuthor(caseId, authorUserId)
  ProgressService -> ProgressRepo: resetCaseUserProgressToSolve(caseId, authorUserId)
  ProgressRepo -> CasesStore: UPDATE case_user_progress (progress_status=in_progress, resolved_at=NULL)
  CasesStore --> ProgressRepo: potvrda reseta statusa
  ProgressRepo --> ProgressService: azuriran progress autora
  ProgressService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> ProgressClient: JSON uspeh
  ProgressClient --> WorkspaceSidebar: Status poruka o vracanju u rezim resavanja

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Vremenska linija"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/vremenska-linija
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Render taba vremenska linija
  Workspace -> TimelineTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  TimelineTab -> TimelineClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/timeline
  TimelineClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> TimelineService: getCreatorCaseTimeline(caseId, userId)
  TimelineService -> CasesRepo: findCaseById(caseId) + provera pristupa
  TimelineService -> CasesStore: ensure case_user_progress za korisnika
  TimelineService -> TimelineRepo: getCaseTimelineItemsByCaseId(caseId)
  TimelineRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT case_timeline_items (redosled + napomene + datum/vreme)
  TimelineRepo -> PeopleStore: SELECT direktorijum osoba za timeline
  TimelineRepo -> DocumentsStore: SELECT direktorijum dokumenata za timeline
  CasesStore --> TimelineRepo: timeline stavke
  PeopleStore --> TimelineRepo: osobe
  DocumentsStore --> TimelineRepo: dokumenti
  TimelineRepo --> TimelineService: timeline payload
  TimelineService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> TimelineClient: JSON uspeh
  TimelineClient --> TimelineTab: Prikaz roadmap-a i dostupnih izvora

  User -> TimelineTab: Dodaje stavke i menja redosled otkljucavanja
  TimelineTab -> TimelineClient: PUT /api/cases/{caseId}/timeline
  TimelineClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> TimelineService: replaceCreatorCaseTimeline(caseId, payload, userId)
  TimelineService -> TimelineRepo: DELETE postojecih + INSERT novih timeline stavki
  TimelineRepo -> CasesStore: WRITE case_timeline_items
  CasesStore --> TimelineRepo: potvrda upisa
  TimelineRepo --> TimelineService: azurirana lista stavki
  TimelineService --> CasesApi: 200 response
  CasesApi --> TimelineClient: JSON uspeh
  TimelineClient --> TimelineTab: Osvjezenje i potvrda cuvanja

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Osobe i dosijei"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/osobe-i-dosijei
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Render taba osobe i dosijei
  Workspace -> PeopleTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  PeopleTab -> PeopleClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/people
  PeopleClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> PeopleService: getCreatorCasePeople(caseId, userId)
  PeopleService -> CasesRepo: findCaseByIdForAuthor(caseId, userId)
  PeopleService -> PeopleRepo: getCasePeopleByCaseId(caseId)
  PeopleRepo -> PeopleStore: SELECT osobe + dosijei
  PeopleStore --> PeopleRepo: lista osoba
  PeopleRepo --> PeopleService: mapirani podaci
  PeopleService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> PeopleClient: JSON uspeh
  PeopleClient --> PeopleTab: Prikaz liste osoba

  PeopleTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/statements + /police-documents
  DocumentsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtevi za povezane dokumente osobe
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> DocumentsService: Ucitavanje izjava i policijskih dokumenata
  DocumentsService -> DocumentsRepo: SELECT case_documents + metadata_json
  DocumentsRepo -> DocumentsStore: Citanje dokumenata slucaja
  DocumentsStore --> DocumentsRepo: dokumenta za mapiranje veza po osobi
  DocumentsRepo --> DocumentsService: mapirani dokumenti
  DocumentsService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> DocumentsClient: JSON uspeh
  DocumentsClient --> PeopleTab: Mapa povezanih dokumenata po osobi

  User -> PeopleTab: Kreira novu osobu/dosije
  PeopleTab -> PeopleClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/people
  PeopleClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> PeopleService: createCreatorCasePerson(caseId, payload, userId)
  PeopleService -> PeopleRepo: INSERT osoba + dosije + profil
  PeopleRepo -> PeopleStore: INSERT case_people + dossier tabele
  PeopleStore --> PeopleRepo: personId/dossierId
  PeopleRepo --> PeopleService: kreirana osoba
  PeopleService --> CasesApi: 201 response
  CasesApi --> PeopleClient: JSON uspeh
  PeopleClient --> PeopleTab: Osvjezenje liste + pregled dosijea

  User -> PeopleTab: U dosijeu klik na povezanu izjavu/dokument
  PeopleTab -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/(izjave|dokumenti)?documentId={id}
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Otvara trazeni tab dokumentacije
  Workspace -> StatementsTab: ili DocsTab ucitava listu
  StatementsTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/statements (ako je izjava)
  DocsTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/police-documents (ako je dokument)
  DocumentsClient --> Workspace: Ucitanje + auto-otvaranje preview modala po documentId

  User -> PeopleTab: U dosijeu klik "Saslusaj osobu"
  PeopleTab -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/resavanje/saslusanja?interrogationPersonId={personId}
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Otvara tab saslusanja u rezimu pregleda
  Workspace -> InterrogationsTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  InterrogationsTab -> InterrogationsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/interrogations
  InterrogationsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> InterrogationsService: getCreatorCaseInterrogations(caseId, userId)
  InterrogationsService -> CasesRepo: Provera autorstva slucaja
  InterrogationsService -> InterrogationsRepo: SELECT saslusanja + cvorovi
  InterrogationsRepo -> InterrogationsStore: SELECT case_interrogations + case_interrogation_nodes
  InterrogationsStore --> InterrogationsRepo: lista saslusanja i stabla
  InterrogationsService -> DocumentsRepo: getCasePeopleDirectoryByCaseId(caseId)
  DocumentsRepo -> PeopleStore: SELECT osobe + status zivosti
  PeopleStore --> DocumentsRepo: direktorijum osoba
  InterrogationsRepo --> InterrogationsService: mapirana saslusanja
  InterrogationsService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> InterrogationsClient: JSON uspeh
  InterrogationsClient --> InterrogationsTab: Auto-otvaranje chat modala po personId

  User -> StatementsTab: U formalnom prikazu klik na povezanu osobu
  StatementsTab -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/osobe-i-dosijei?personId={id}
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Otvara tab osobe i dosijei
  Workspace -> PeopleTab: Ucitava osobe i otvara dosije po personId

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Izjave"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/izjave
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Render taba izjave
  Workspace -> StatementsTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  StatementsTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/statements
  DocumentsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> DocumentsService: getCreatorCaseStatements(caseId, userId)
  DocumentsService -> CasesRepo: Provera autorstva slucaja
  DocumentsService -> DocumentsRepo: getCaseDocumentsByCaseIdAndTypes(caseId, statementTypes)
  DocumentsRepo -> DocumentsStore: SELECT izjave + metadata_json
  DocumentsStore --> DocumentsRepo: lista izjava
  DocumentsRepo --> DocumentsService: mapirani dokumenti + direktorijum osoba
  DocumentsService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> DocumentsClient: JSON uspeh
  DocumentsClient --> StatementsTab: Lista izjava + osobe

  User -> StatementsTab: Popunjava i cuva novu izjavu (sa tip-specificnim poljima)
  StatementsTab -> DocumentsClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/statements
  DocumentsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> DocumentsService: createCreatorCaseStatement(caseId, payload, userId)
  DocumentsService -> CasesRepo: Provera autorstva slucaja
  DocumentsService -> DocumentsRepo: getCasePeopleDirectoryByCaseId(caseId)
  DocumentsRepo -> PeopleStore: SELECT osobe u slucaju
  PeopleStore --> DocumentsRepo: ljudi za validaciju
  DocumentsService -> DocumentsRepo: createCaseDocumentForCase(caseId, payload + metadata.typeSpecific)
  DocumentsRepo -> DocumentsStore: INSERT case_documents (tip izjave + metadata_json)
  DocumentsStore --> DocumentsRepo: documentId
  DocumentsRepo --> DocumentsService: kreirana izjava
  DocumentsService --> CasesApi: 201 response
  CasesApi --> DocumentsClient: JSON uspeh
  DocumentsClient --> StatementsTab: Osvjezenje liste + formalni preview izjave

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Dokumenti"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/dokumenti
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Render taba dokumenti
  Workspace -> DocsTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  DocsTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/police-documents
  DocumentsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> DocumentsService: getCreatorCasePoliceDocuments(caseId, userId)
  DocumentsService -> DocumentsRepo: SELECT police_report + forensic_report
  DocumentsRepo -> DocumentsStore: SELECT case_documents + metadata_json
  DocumentsStore --> DocumentsRepo: lista policijskih dokumenata
  DocumentsRepo --> DocumentsService: mapirani dokumenti + osobe
  DocumentsService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> DocumentsClient: JSON uspeh
  DocumentsClient --> DocsTab: Lista izvjestaja i nalaza

  User -> DocsTab: Kreira policijski izvjestaj ili forenzicki nalaz (tip-specificna polja + slike)
  DocsTab -> DocumentsClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/police-documents
  DocumentsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> DocumentsService: createCreatorCasePoliceDocument(caseId, payload, userId)
  DocumentsService -> DocumentsRepo: validacija osoba + tip-specificnih polja + imageEvidence
  DocumentsRepo -> DocumentsStore: INSERT case_documents (metadata_json sa typeSpecific + imageEvidence)
  DocumentsStore --> DocumentsRepo: documentId
  DocumentsRepo --> DocumentsService: kreiran dokument
  DocumentsService --> CasesApi: 201 response
  CasesApi --> DocumentsClient: JSON uspeh
  DocumentsClient --> DocsTab: Osvjezenje liste + formalni preview dokumenta

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Saslusanja"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/saslusanja
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Render taba saslusanja
  Workspace -> InterrogationsTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  InterrogationsTab -> InterrogationsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/interrogations
  InterrogationsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> InterrogationsService: getCreatorCaseInterrogations(caseId, userId)
  InterrogationsService -> InterrogationsRepo: getCaseInterrogationsByCaseId(caseId)
  InterrogationsRepo -> InterrogationsStore: SELECT saslusanja + cvorovi
  InterrogationsStore --> InterrogationsRepo: lista saslusanja
  InterrogationsService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> InterrogationsClient: JSON uspeh
  InterrogationsClient --> InterrogationsTab: Lista saslusanja + izbor osobe

  User -> InterrogationsTab: Kreira saslusanje po osobi (vizuelni tree builder)
  InterrogationsTab -> InterrogationsTab: Dodavanje pitanja / reuse postojeceg pitanja po granama
  InterrogationsTab -> InterrogationsClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/interrogations
  InterrogationsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> InterrogationsService: createCreatorCaseInterrogation(caseId, payload, userId)
  InterrogationsService -> DocumentsRepo: getCasePeopleDirectoryByCaseId(caseId)
  InterrogationsService -> InterrogationsRepo: upsertCaseInterrogationForPerson(caseId, payload, userId)
  InterrogationsRepo -> InterrogationsStore: UPSERT case_interrogations + INSERT case_interrogation_nodes(question_reference_key)
  InterrogationsStore --> InterrogationsRepo: interrogationId + stablo
  InterrogationsRepo --> InterrogationsService: sacuvano saslusanje
  InterrogationsService --> CasesApi: 201 response
  CasesApi --> InterrogationsClient: JSON uspeh
  InterrogationsClient --> InterrogationsTab: Osvjezenje + otvaranje chat modala
  User -> InterrogationsTab: Dolazi do kraja grane i bira "Zakljuci saslusanje"
  InterrogationsTab --> User: Chat oznacava razgovor kao zakljucen

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Kviz" (kreiranje)
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/kviz
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Creatorski prikaz zavrsnog kviza
  Workspace -> QuizTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  QuizTab -> QuizClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/quiz?scope=create
  QuizClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> QuizService: getCaseQuiz(caseId, userId, "create")
  QuizService -> CasesRepo: findCaseByIdForAuthor(caseId, userId)
  QuizService -> QuizRepo: getCaseQuizQuestionsByCaseId(caseId, includeCorrect=true)
  QuizRepo -> QuizStore: SELECT pitanja i odgovori
  QuizStore --> QuizRepo: quiz pitanja
  QuizRepo --> QuizService: mapiran quiz payload
  QuizService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> QuizClient: JSON uspeh
  QuizClient --> QuizTab: Prikaz/edit pitanja, odgovora i objasnjenja

  note right of QuizTab
    Kreatorski pregled statistike i recenzija
    nije dio `kviz` taba.
    Prikazuje se kroz popup panel
    sa ulogovane pocetne stranice.
  end note

  User -> QuizTab: Dodaje pitanja i cuva zavrsni kviz
  QuizTab -> QuizClient: PUT /api/cases/{caseId}/quiz
  QuizClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> QuizService: upsertCreatorCaseQuiz(caseId, payload, userId)
  QuizService -> QuizRepo: replaceCaseQuizQuestions(caseId, questions)
  QuizRepo -> QuizStore: DELETE stari + INSERT nova pitanja/odgovore
  QuizStore --> QuizRepo: potvrda upisa
  QuizRepo --> QuizService: osvezen kviz
  QuizService --> CasesApi: 200 response
  CasesApi --> QuizClient: JSON uspeh
  QuizClient --> QuizTab: Potvrda cuvanja kviza

  User -> LoggedHome: Klik "Nastavi resavanje"
  LoggedHome -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/resavanje/vremenska-linija
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Solve mode (postepeno otkljucavanje)
  Workspace -> CasesClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/overview?scope=solve
  CasesClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> CasesService: getCaseWorkspaceOverview(caseId, userId, "solve")
  CasesService -> CasesRepo: findCaseById(caseId) + provera pristupa
  CasesService -> SolveVisibility: getSolveVisibilityForUser(caseId, userId)
  CasesService -> SolveRoles: getSolvePeopleRoleState(caseId, userId, unlockedPersonIds)
  CasesService -> QuizRepo: getCaseQuizQuestionCount(caseId)
  SolveVisibility -> TimelineRepo: SELECT case_timeline_items
  SolveVisibility -> CasesStore: SELECT/ensure case_user_progress
  SolveRoles -> PeopleRepo: SELECT case_people + role assignments
  QuizRepo -> QuizStore: SELECT broj kviz pitanja
  CasesStore --> SolveVisibility: case_user_progress red
  TimelineRepo --> SolveVisibility: timeline stavke
  PeopleRepo --> SolveRoles: mapirane uloge korisnika
  QuizStore --> QuizRepo: broj pitanja
  CasesService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> CasesClient: JSON uspeh
  CasesClient --> Workspace: Opis slucaja + napredak + kviz spremnost + role readiness
  Workspace --> WorkspaceSidebar: Tab "Kviz" je sakriven dok role readiness nije ispunjen
  Workspace -> TimelineTab: Prikaz sa akcijom "Dalje"
  TimelineTab -> TimelineClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/timeline
  TimelineClient --> TimelineTab: Trenutno otkljucane stavke + procenat istrage
  User -> TimelineTab: Klik "Dalje"
  TimelineTab -> TimelineClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/timeline/advance
  TimelineClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> TimelineService: advanceCaseTimeline(caseId, userId)
  TimelineService -> CasesStore: UPDATE case_user_progress (unlocked_timeline_count, progress_percent)
  TimelineService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> TimelineClient: JSON uspeh
  TimelineClient --> TimelineTab: Najnovije otkljucano na vrhu + trenutni datum

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Osobe i dosijei" (solve)
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/resavanje/osobe-i-dosijei
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Solve mode prikaz osoba
  Workspace -> PeopleTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  PeopleTab -> PeopleClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/people?scope=solve
  PeopleClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> PeopleService: getCreatorCasePeople(caseId, userId, "solve")
  PeopleService -> SolveVisibility: getSolveVisibilityForUser(caseId, userId)
  PeopleService -> SolveRoles: getSolvePeopleRoleState(caseId, userId, unlockedPeople)
  SolveRoles -> PeopleRepo: getCasePersonRoleSelectionsByPersonIds(caseId, userId, unlockedPeople)
  PeopleRepo -> PeopleStore: SELECT case_person_role_assignments
  PeopleStore --> PeopleRepo: izabrane uloge po osobi
  SolveVisibility -> TimelineRepo: SELECT case_timeline_items ORDER BY unlock_order
  SolveVisibility -> CasesStore: SELECT/ensure case_user_progress za korisnika
  PeopleService --> CasesApi: filtrirane osobe sa korisnickim ulogama (inicijalno unknown)
  CasesApi --> PeopleClient: JSON uspeh
  PeopleClient --> PeopleTab: Prikaz samo otkljucanih osoba

  User -> PeopleTab: Menja procenjenu ulogu osobe
  PeopleTab -> PeopleClient: PUT /api/cases/{caseId}/people/{personId}/role
  PeopleClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> PeopleService: updateSolveCasePersonRole(caseId, personId, role, userId)
  PeopleService -> PeopleRepo: upsertCasePersonRoleSelection(caseId, personId, userId, role)
  PeopleRepo -> PeopleStore: UPSERT case_person_role_assignments
  PeopleStore --> PeopleRepo: potvrda cuvanja
  PeopleService --> CasesApi: roleProgress (allRolesResolved)
  CasesApi --> PeopleClient: JSON uspeh
  PeopleClient --> Workspace: Osvezen role readiness za prikaz opcije "Rijesi slucaj"

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Izjave" ili "Dokumenti" (solve)
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/resavanje/(izjave|dokumenti)
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Solve mode prikaz dokumentacije
  Workspace -> StatementsTab: ili DocsTab
  StatementsTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/statements?scope=solve
  DocsTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/police-documents?scope=solve
  DocumentsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> DocumentsService: getCreatorCaseStatements/PoliceDocuments(..., "solve")
  DocumentsService -> SolveVisibility: getSolveVisibilityForUser(caseId, userId)
  DocumentsService --> CasesApi: filtrirani dokumenti + filtrirane osobe
  CasesApi --> DocumentsClient: JSON uspeh
  DocumentsClient --> StatementsTab: Prikaz samo otkljucanih izjava
  DocumentsClient --> DocsTab: Prikaz samo otkljucanih dokumenata

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Saslusanja" (solve)
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/resavanje/saslusanja
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Solve mode prikaz saslusanja
  Workspace -> InterrogationsTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  InterrogationsTab -> InterrogationsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/interrogations?scope=solve
  InterrogationsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> InterrogationsService: getCreatorCaseInterrogations(caseId, userId, "solve")
  InterrogationsService -> SolveVisibility: getSolveVisibilityForUser(caseId, userId)
  InterrogationsService --> CasesApi: filtrirana saslusanja + filtrirane osobe
  CasesApi --> InterrogationsClient: JSON uspeh
  InterrogationsClient --> InterrogationsTab: Samo saslusanja otkljucanih osoba

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik "Rijesi slucaj"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/resavanje/kviz
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Solve tab zavrsnog kviza
  Workspace -> QuizTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  QuizTab -> QuizClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/quiz?scope=solve
  QuizClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> QuizService: getCaseQuiz(caseId, userId, "solve")
  QuizService -> CasesRepo: findCaseById(caseId) + provera pristupa
  QuizService -> SolveVisibility: getSolveVisibilityForUser(caseId, userId)
  QuizService -> SolveRoles: getSolvePeopleRoleState(caseId, userId, unlockedPersonIds)
  QuizService -> QuizRepo: getCaseQuizQuestionsByCaseId(caseId, includeCorrect=true)
  QuizService -> QuizRepo: getCaseQuizUserResult(caseId, userId)
  QuizRepo -> QuizStore: SELECT pitanja + poslednji rezultat korisnika
  QuizStore --> QuizRepo: quiz podaci + rezultat
  QuizService --> CasesApi: response payload + blockers (timeline/role readiness)
  CasesApi --> QuizClient: JSON uspeh
  QuizClient --> QuizTab: Prikaz opisa slucaja i pitanja kviza

  QuizTab -> ReviewsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/reviews?scope=solve
  ReviewsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> ReviewsService: getCaseReviews(caseId, userId, "solve")
  ReviewsService -> CasesRepo: findCaseById(caseId) + provera pristupa
  ReviewsService -> ProgressRepo: getCaseUserProgressByCaseIdAndUserId(caseId, userId)
  alt Korisnik je vec ostavio ocjenu
    ReviewsService -> ReviewsRepo: getCaseReviewSummary(caseId)
    ReviewsService -> ReviewsRepo: getCaseReviewsByCaseId(caseId)
    ReviewsRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT recenzije + komentari
    CasesStore --> ReviewsRepo: lista recenzija
    ReviewsService --> CasesApi: response payload
    CasesApi --> ReviewsClient: JSON uspeh
    ReviewsClient --> QuizTab: Prikaz prosjeka, broja recenzija i komentara
  else Korisnik jos nije ocijenio slucaj
    ReviewsService --> CasesApi: 403 (zakljucan pregled recenzija)
    CasesApi --> ReviewsClient: JSON greska
    ReviewsClient --> QuizTab: Prikaz forme za jednokratno ocjenjivanje
  end

  User -> QuizTab: Predaje odgovore zavrsnog kviza
  QuizTab -> QuizClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/quiz/submit
  QuizClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> QuizService: submitCaseQuiz(caseId, answers, userId)
  QuizService -> QuizRepo: upsertCaseQuizUserResult(caseId, userId, score)
  QuizRepo -> QuizStore: UPSERT case_quiz_user_results
  QuizStore --> QuizRepo: cuvan rezultat pokusaja

  alt Rezultat > 80% tacnih
    QuizService -> CasesStore: UPDATE case_user_progress(status=resolved, resolved_at, progress=100)
    QuizService --> CasesApi: response payload sa review podacima
    CasesApi --> QuizClient: JSON uspeh (slucaj rijesen)
    QuizClient --> QuizTab: Prikaz tacnih odgovora + objasnjenja + vrijeme rjesavanja
    User -> QuizTab: Salje jednokratnu ocjenu i opcioni komentar
    QuizTab -> ReviewsClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/reviews
    ReviewsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
    CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
    JwtGuard -> ReviewsService: submitCaseReview(caseId, payload, userId)
    ReviewsService -> ProgressRepo: ensure/get case_user_progress za korisnika
    ReviewsService -> ReviewsRepo: saveCaseUserReview(caseId, userId, rating+comment)
    ReviewsRepo -> CasesStore: UPDATE case_user_progress(user_rating, user_review_comment, user_rated_at)
    ReviewsService -> ReviewsRepo: recalculateCaseRatings(caseId)
    ReviewsRepo -> CasesStore: UPDATE cases(average_rating, rating_count)
    ReviewsService -> ReviewsRepo: getCaseReviewSummary + getCaseReviewsByCaseId
    ReviewsRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT agregat + komentari
    CasesStore --> ReviewsRepo: summary + reviews
    ReviewsService --> CasesApi: response payload
    CasesApi --> ReviewsClient: 201 JSON uspeh
    ReviewsClient --> QuizTab: Prikaz prosjecne ocjene, broja recenzija i komentara
    QuizTab --> LoggedHome: Slucaj prelazi u listu "Reseni slucajevi"
  else Rezultat <= 80% tacnih
    QuizService --> CasesApi: response payload bez tacnih odgovora
    CasesApi --> QuizClient: JSON odgovor (slucaj ostaje in_progress)
    QuizClient --> QuizTab: Poruka o nedovoljnom rezultatu i nastavku istrage
  end

  User -> LoggedHome: Klik "Profil"
  LoggedHome -> Router: /profil
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> ProfilePage: Render stranice profila
  ProfilePage -> ProfileClient: GET /api/profile
  ProfileClient -> ProfileApi: HTTP zahtev
  ProfileApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> ProfileService: getMyProfile(userId)
  ProfileService -> ProfileRepo: findProfileUserById(userId)
  ProfileRepo -> UsersStore: SELECT user row
  UsersStore --> ProfileRepo: user podaci
  ProfileService -> ProfileRepo: getProfileUserActivity(userId)
  ProfileRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT created/resolved/rating aktivnosti
  ProfileRepo -> UsersStore: JOIN autori za date ocene
  CasesStore --> ProfileRepo: agregati i liste aktivnosti
  UsersStore --> ProfileRepo: autor podaci
  ProfileRepo --> ProfileService: user + activity payload
  ProfileService --> ProfileApi: response payload
  ProfileApi --> ProfileClient: JSON uspeh
  ProfileClient --> ProfilePage: Prikaz profila i aktivnosti

  User -> ProfilePage: Menja osnovne podatke
  ProfilePage -> ProfileClient: PUT /api/profile/basic
  ProfileClient -> ProfileApi: HTTP zahtev
  ProfileApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> ProfileService: updateMyProfileBasic(userId, payload)
  ProfileService -> ProfileRepo: findUserByEmailExceptId(email, userId)
  ProfileRepo -> UsersStore: SELECT konflikt email-a
  ProfileService -> ProfileRepo: updateProfileUserBasicById(userId, payload)
  ProfileRepo -> UsersStore: UPDATE users(first_name, last_name, email)
  UsersStore --> ProfileRepo: azuriran user
  ProfileRepo --> ProfileService: user payload
  ProfileService --> ProfileApi: response payload
  ProfileApi --> ProfileClient: JSON uspeh
  ProfileClient --> ProfilePage: Potvrda + osvezenje lokalne sesije

  User -> ProfilePage: Menja lozinku
  ProfilePage -> ProfileClient: PUT /api/profile/password
  ProfileClient -> ProfileApi: HTTP zahtev
  ProfileApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> ProfileService: updateMyProfilePassword(userId, payload)
  ProfileService -> ProfileRepo: findProfileUserByIdWithPassword(userId)
  ProfileRepo -> UsersStore: SELECT user + password_hash
  ProfileService -> ProfileRepo: updateProfileUserPasswordById(userId, passwordHash)
  ProfileRepo -> UsersStore: UPDATE users(password_hash)
  ProfileService --> ProfileApi: response payload
  ProfileApi --> ProfileClient: JSON uspeh
  ProfileClient --> ProfilePage: Potvrda promene lozinke

  User -> ProfilePage: Brise nalog
  ProfilePage -> ProfileClient: DELETE /api/profile
  ProfileClient -> ProfileApi: HTTP zahtev
  ProfileApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> ProfileService: deleteMyProfile(userId, payload)
  ProfileService -> ProfileRepo: findProfileUserByIdWithPassword(userId)
  ProfileRepo -> UsersStore: SELECT user + password_hash
  ProfileService -> ProfileRepo: deleteProfileUserById(userId)
  ProfileRepo -> UsersStore: DELETE users (cascade na povezane podatke)
  ProfileService --> ProfileApi: response payload
  ProfileApi --> ProfileClient: JSON uspeh
  ProfileClient -> SessionStore: clearSession()
  ProfileClient --> Router: Redirect /

  User -> LoggedHome: Klik "Podrska"
  LoggedHome -> Router: /podrska
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> SupportPage: Render stranice za podrsku
  SupportPage -> SupportClient: GET /api/support/tickets/me
  SupportClient -> SupportApi: HTTP zahtev
  SupportApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> SupportService: getMySupportTickets(userId)
  SupportService -> SupportRepo: getSupportTicketsByReporterUserId(userId)
  SupportRepo -> SupportStore: SELECT support_tickets po reporter_user_id
  SupportRepo -> UsersStore: JOIN users (nalog prijave)
  SupportStore --> SupportRepo: lista tiketa
  UsersStore --> SupportRepo: reporter podaci
  SupportRepo --> SupportService: mapirani ticketi
  SupportService --> SupportApi: response payload
  SupportApi --> SupportClient: JSON uspeh
  SupportClient --> SupportPage: Lista korisnickih tiketa

  User -> SupportPage: Kreira novi tiket
  SupportPage -> SupportClient: POST /api/support/tickets
  SupportClient -> SupportApi: HTTP zahtev
  SupportApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> SupportService: createSupportTicketForUser(payload, userId)
  SupportService -> SupportRepo: INSERT support_tickets
  SupportRepo -> SupportStore: INSERT (tip, naslov, opis, lokacija, verzija, status=open)
  SupportStore --> SupportRepo: ticketId
  SupportRepo -> UsersStore: JOIN users po reporter_user_id
  SupportRepo --> SupportService: kreiran tiket
  SupportService --> SupportApi: 201 response
  SupportApi --> SupportClient: JSON uspeh
  SupportClient --> SupportPage: Osvjezenje liste tiketa

  Admin -> AdminLoginView: Otvara http://localhost:5174 i unosi kredencijale
  AdminLoginView -> AdminClient: POST /api/admin/login
  AdminClient -> AdminApi: HTTP zahtev
  AdminApi -> AdminService: loginToAdminPanel(email, password, panelPassword)
  AdminService -> UsersStore: SELECT user po email + role
  UsersStore --> AdminService: admin user row
  AdminService --> AdminApi: admin JWT token + admin user
  AdminApi --> AdminClient: JSON uspeh
  AdminClient -> AdminSessionStore: Upis admin tokena
  AdminLoginView -> AdminDashboard: Render dashboard prikaza

  AdminDashboard -> AdminClient: GET /api/admin/overview
  AdminClient -> AdminApi: HTTP zahtev
  AdminApi -> AdminGuard: Verifikacija admin tokena
  AdminGuard -> AdminService: getAdminOverview()
  AdminService -> AdminRepo: getAdminOverviewCounts()
  AdminRepo -> UsersStore: SELECT broj korisnika/admina
  AdminRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT broj slucajeva
  AdminRepo -> SupportStore: SELECT broj tiketa po statusima
  AdminRepo --> AdminService: overview metrika
  AdminService --> AdminApi: response payload
  AdminApi --> AdminClient: JSON uspeh
  AdminClient --> AdminDashboard: Brzi pregled metrika

  AdminDashboard -> AdminClient: GET /api/admin/tickets
  AdminClient -> AdminApi: HTTP zahtev
  AdminApi -> AdminGuard: Verifikacija admin tokena
  AdminGuard -> AdminService: getAdminTickets()
  AdminService -> SupportRepo: getAllSupportTickets()
  SupportRepo -> SupportStore: SELECT svi ticketi
  SupportRepo -> UsersStore: JOIN nalog prijave po ticketu
  SupportRepo --> AdminService: ticketi + reporter podaci
  AdminService --> AdminApi: response payload
  AdminApi --> AdminClient: JSON uspeh
  AdminClient --> AdminDashboard: Lista tiketa

  Admin -> AdminDashboard: Menja status tiketa
  AdminDashboard -> AdminClient: PATCH /api/admin/tickets/{ticketId}/status
  AdminClient -> AdminApi: HTTP zahtev
  AdminApi -> AdminGuard: Verifikacija admin tokena
  AdminGuard -> AdminService: patchAdminTicketStatus(ticketId, payload)
  AdminService -> SupportRepo: updateSupportTicketStatus(ticketId, status, adminNote)
  SupportRepo -> SupportStore: UPDATE status/admin_note
  SupportStore --> SupportRepo: potvrda izmene
  SupportRepo --> AdminService: azuriran tiket
  AdminService --> AdminApi: 200 response
  AdminApi --> AdminClient: JSON uspeh
  AdminClient --> AdminDashboard: Osvjezen status tiketa

  AdminDashboard -> AdminClient: GET /api/admin/users + /api/admin/cases
  AdminClient -> AdminApi: HTTP zahtevi
  AdminApi -> AdminGuard: Verifikacija admin tokena
  AdminGuard -> AdminService: listAdminUsers() + listAdminCases()
  AdminService -> AdminRepo: getAdminUsers() + getAdminCases()
  AdminRepo -> UsersStore: SELECT korisnici (bez password_hash)
  AdminRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT slucajevi + autori
  AdminRepo --> AdminService: liste za edit
  AdminService --> AdminApi: response payload
  AdminApi --> AdminClient: JSON uspeh
  AdminClient --> AdminDashboard: Tabele korisnika i slucajeva

  Admin -> AdminDashboard: Klik "Obrisi" na korisniku
  AdminDashboard -> AdminClient: DELETE /api/admin/users/{userId}
  AdminClient -> AdminApi: HTTP zahtev
  AdminApi -> AdminGuard: Verifikacija admin tokena
  AdminGuard -> AdminService: deleteAdminUser(userId, adminUserId)
  AdminService -> AdminRepo: findAdminUserById(userId) + countAdminUsers()
  AdminRepo -> UsersStore: SELECT korisnik + broj admin naloga
  AdminService -> AdminRepo: deleteAdminUserById(userId)
  AdminRepo -> UsersStore: DELETE users (cascade povezani podaci)
  UsersStore --> AdminRepo: potvrda brisanja
  AdminRepo --> AdminService: delete uspeh
  AdminService --> AdminApi: 200 response
  AdminApi --> AdminClient: JSON uspeh
  AdminClient --> AdminDashboard: Osvjezena lista korisnika
else Manja sirina od desktop praga
  Gate -> Notice: Render poruke "Aplikacija je samo za desktop"
  Notice --> User: Prikaz ogranicenog ekrana
end

@enduml
